(Hook, Trending, and Compare Score Algorithms - Mathematical Explainer) Tj
T*
(Generated: 2026-02-24 10:11) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1\) Purpose and Output) Tj
T*
(- Hook Score: long-horizon discovery ranking score in product_dynamic_score \(0 to 100\).) Tj
T*
(- Trending Score: short-horizon momentum score in product_trending_score \(0 to 100\).) Tj
T*
(- Compare Score: session-time ranking among selected devices \(2 to 4 devices\), returned by compare API.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2\) Data Signals Used) Tj
T*
(Hook Score uses: unique product views, comparisons, wishlist adds, launch age \(freshness decay\).) Tj
T*
(Trending Score uses: unique product views, comparisons, view velocity over two windows.) Tj
T*
(Compare Score uses: device specs + selected variant/base price, plus admin config weights and chipset) Tj
T*
(rules.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3\) Hook Score \(server/utils/hookScore.js\)) Tj
T*
(Window setup:) Tj
T*
(- days = 7 \(default\), lookbackDays = 14) Tj
T*
(- smoothing s = 5) Tj
T*
(- freshness parameter tau = 365 days \(variable name says half-life, but mathematically this is a decay) Tj
T*
(constant\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Raw components per product:) Tj
T*
(views_velocity_raw = max\(0, \(\(views_recent + s\)/\(views_previous + s\)\) - 1\)) Tj
T*
(compares_velocity_raw = max\(0, \(\(compares_recent + s\)/\(compares_previous + s\)\) - 1\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Normalization to 0..100 inside the evaluated product cohort:) Tj
T*
(norm_x = 100 * x / max\(x\)) Tj
T*
(Applied to views_recent, compares_recent, wishlist_recent, views_velocity_raw, compares_velocity_raw.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Freshness:) Tj
T*
(freshness = clamp\(100 * exp\(-age_days / tau\), 0, 100\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Subscores \(default weights\):) Tj
T*
(buyer_intent = clamp\(\(0.55*norm_views + 0.30*norm_compares + 0.15*norm_wishlist\)/1.0, 0, 100\)) Tj
T*
(trend_velocity = clamp\(\(0.70*norm_views_velocity + 0.30*norm_compares_velocity\)/1.0, 0, 100\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Final Hook score:) Tj
T*
(hook_score = clamp\(\(0.50*buyer_intent + 0.30*trend_velocity + 0.20*freshness\)/1.0, 0, 100\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Worked example \(Phone A\):) Tj
T*
(- views_recent=1200, views_previous=800, compares_recent=240, compares_previous=160,) Tj
T*
(wishlist_recent=300, age_days=90) Tj
T*
(- views_velocity_raw=0.496894, compares_velocity_raw=0.484848) Tj
T*
(- norm_views=100.00, norm_compares=80.00, norm_wishlist=100.00) Tj
T*
(- norm_views_velocity=62.11, norm_compares_velocity=80.81) Tj
T*
(- buyer_intent=94.00, trend_velocity=67.72, freshness=78.15) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
