14 TL
(- hook_score=82.95) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4\) Trending Score \(server/utils/trendingScore.js\)) Tj
T*
(Window setup:) Tj
T*
(- days = 7 \(default\), previous window = previous 7 days) Tj
T*
(- smoothing s = 5) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Velocity term:) Tj
T*
(velocity_raw = max\(0, \(\(views_7d + s\)/\(views_prev_7d + s\)\) - 1\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Normalization:) Tj
T*
(- norm_views, norm_compares, norm_velocity are scaled 0..100 using partition max values by product_type.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Final Trending score \(default weights\):) Tj
T*
(trending_score = \(0.40*norm_views + 0.40*norm_compares + 0.20*norm_velocity\)/1.0) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Worked example \(Phone A values from above assumptions\):) Tj
T*
(- norm_views=100.00, norm_compares=80.00, norm_velocity=62.11) Tj
T*
(- trending_score=84.42) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5\) Compare Score \(server/utils/compareScoring.js\)) Tj
T*
(This is computed only for the selected comparison set and selected variants/prices.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.1 Performance score) Tj
T*
(- scoreChipset\(\) uses keyword rules first \(admin-managed\), then heuristic fallbacks for) Tj
T*
(Snapdragon/Dimensity/Apple/Tensor/Exynos.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.2 Display score) Tj
T*
(refresh_rate_score = round\(20 + \(\(clamp\(refresh_rate,60,165\)-60\)/\(165-60\)\)*40\)) Tj
T*
(panel_score from panel text: LTPO=40, AMOLED=34, OLED=32, IPS/LCD=24, TFT=16, etc.) Tj
T*
(display_score = clamp\(refresh_rate_score + panel_score, 0, 100\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.3 Camera score) Tj
T*
(megapixel_score = clamp\(\(main_megapixel/108\)*65, 18, 65\)) Tj
T*
(sensor_score = clamp\(sensor_count*8.75, 10, 35\)) Tj
T*
(camera_score = clamp\(megapixel_score + sensor_score, 0, 100\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.4 Battery score) Tj
T*
(Piecewise map by capacity: <=3000:25, <=4000:45, <=4500:60, <=5000:75, <=5500:86, <=6000:94, >6000:100) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.5 Base spec score) Tj
T*
(base_spec_score = 0.40*performance + 0.20*display + 0.25*camera + 0.15*battery) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.6 Price value score) Tj
T*
(value_raw = base_spec_score / price) Tj
T*
(If no price: value_score=45) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
