BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 800 Td
14 TL
(If all compared devices have same value_raw: value_score=70) Tj
T*
(Else: value_score = 35 + \(\(value_raw - min_value\)/\(max_value - min_value\)\)*65) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.7 Final compare overall score) Tj
T*
(overall_score = w_perf*performance + w_disp*display + w_cam*camera + w_batt*battery +) Tj
T*
(w_price*value_score) Tj
T*
(Default weights: performance=0.36, display=0.20, camera=0.20, battery=0.14, priceValue=0.10) Tj
T*
(Then rank by overall_score DESC, tie-breaker: lower price first, then name.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Worked compare example \(3 phones\):) Tj
T*
(- Phone B: perf=75.00, display=77.00, camera=82.50, battery=86.00, value_score=100.00, overall=80.94,) Tj
T*
(price=30000) Tj
T*
(- Phone A: perf=95.00, display=77.00, camera=56.34, battery=75.00, value_score=66.17, overall=77.99,) Tj
T*
(price=39999) Tj
T*
(- Phone C: perf=100.00, display=92.00, camera=56.34, battery=60.00, value_score=35.00, overall=77.57,) Tj
T*
(price=60000) Tj
T*
(Ranking outcome for this example:) Tj
T*
(1. Phone B \(overall=80.94\)) Tj
T*
(2. Phone A \(overall=77.99\)) Tj
T*
(3. Phone C \(overall=77.57\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6\) API JSON Bodies \(final look\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.1 Recompute Hook score \(admin\)) Tj
T*
(POST /api/admin/hook-score/recompute) Tj
T*
(Body: {}   \(no payload required\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Sample response:) Tj
T*
({"ok":true,"updated":123,"results":{"smartphones":{"updated":80},"laptops":{"updated":30},"tvs":{"updated":13}}}) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.2 Recompute Trending score \(admin\)) Tj
T*
(POST /api/admin/trending/recompute) Tj
T*
(Body: {}   \(no payload required\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Sample response:) Tj
T*
({"ok":true,"skipped":false,"updated":250,"days":7}) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.3 Manual Trending boost \(admin\)) Tj
T*
(POST /api/admin/trending/boost) Tj
T*
(Body:) Tj
T*
({"product_id":124,"manual_boost":true,"manual_priority":5,"manual_badge":"editor_pick"}) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.4 Update Compare scoring config \(admin\)) Tj
T*
(PUT /api/admin/compare-scoring) Tj
T*
(Body:) Tj
T*
({"weights":{"performance":36,"display":20,"camera":20,"battery":14,"priceValue":10},"chipset_rules":[{"keyword":"snapdragon) Tj
T*
ET
