T*
(7\) Is there a connection between the three algorithms?) Tj
T*
(Yes, but only partial:) Tj
T*
(- Hook Score and Trending Score are behavior-driven and share core engagement signals \(views +) Tj
T*
(compares\).) Tj
T*
(- Hook adds wishlist + freshness + a second-level weighted composition.) Tj
T*
(- Trending is short-horizon momentum and supports manual editorial boosts.) Tj
T*
(- Compare Score is different: it is spec + price driven for a selected comparison set, not a global) Tj
T*
(popularity rank.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Practical interpretation:) Tj
T*
(- Hook answers: What should rank well overall in discovery feeds?) Tj
T*
(- Trending answers: What is hot right now?) Tj
T*
(- Compare answers: Among selected devices, which is technically and value-wise better?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8\) One unified output example \(for understanding only\)) Tj
T*
({"product_id":124,"name":"Phone) Tj
T*
